
---

## **📌 .gitignore File**
Create a `.gitignore` file and add:

```gitignore
# Ignore .NET build files
bin/
obj/

# Ignore user-specific files
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.vs

# Ignore logs and secrets
*.log
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json

# Ignore database migrations
Migrations/
